  section 2 Analisis dan perancangan
  2.1 Analisis kebutuhan dan data         :t21, 2026-10-23, 3d
  2.2 Use case, activity, sequence, flow  :t22, 2026-10-26, 3d
  2.3 ERD, LRS, kamus data                :t23, 2026-10-28, 3d
  2.4 Design system dan mockup            :t24, 2026-10-30, 3d
