  3.2 Frontend pelanggan                  :t32, 2026-11-04, 4d
  3.3 Frontend kasir dan manajer          :t33, 2026-11-07, 4d
  3.4 Integrasi dan deployment            :t34, 2026-11-11, 3d
  section 4 Pengujian dan penutupan
  4.1 Unit test dan black box             :t41, 2026-11-13, 3d
  4.2 UAT                                 :t42, 2026-11-16, 2d
  4.3 Perbaikan bug, QR, rilis            :t43, 2026-11-17, 2d
  4.4 Laporan, demo, serah terima         :t44, 2026-11-18, 3d
  Serah terima (BAST)                     :milestone, m3, 2026-11-21, 0d
